WEBVTT

00:08.740 --> 00:15.340
<b>Dareka ga sutete-shimatta
kinou o hiroi-age</b>

00:15.340 --> 00:18.680
<b>Gamushara ni te o nobashita</b>

00:18.680 --> 00:21.980
<b>Kotae o tsukitsukete</b>

00:21.980 --> 00:27.440
<b>Nani o te ni iretemo manzoku
suru koto wa nai</b>

00:28.620 --> 00:34.560
<b>Fukuzatsu ni karanda kokoro no
sukima kara nigedase</b>

00:34.560 --> 00:36.630
<b>Sou sa, make a treasure</b>

00:36.630 --> 00:41.870
<b>Sabitsuita toki no naka ni
kimi no koe o kiku</b>

00:41.870 --> 00:44.910
<b>Kono mama todoketai</b>

00:44.910 --> 00:48.180
<b>Hikari no naka kimi ga matteru</b>

00:48.180 --> 00:51.810
<b>Sou shinjiteru kara</b>

00:51.810 --> 00:55.410
<b>lma sugu ni</b>

01:05.990 --> 01:08.030
<b>Dakara, make a treasure</b>

01:08.030 --> 01:13.270
<b>Sabitsuita kagami no naka
jibun o sagashite</b>

01:13.270 --> 01:16.370
<b>Kono te de tsukamitai</b>

01:16.370 --> 01:19.610
<b>Doko ni itemo kimi ga matteru</b>

01:19.610 --> 01:23.180
<b>Sou shinjiteru kara</b>

01:23.180 --> 01:25.840
<b>lma sugu ni</b>

01:40.860 --> 01:43.630
<b>You just ate a potsticker without
permission, didn't you?!</b>

01:43.630 --> 01:45.230
<b>No, I didn't.</b>

01:45.230 --> 01:48.840
<b>Have your eyes gone stupid too?
What a poor, stupid monkey.</b>

01:48.840 --> 01:51.040
<b>What'd you say, you stinking
water sprite?!</b>

01:51.040 --> 01:53.840
<b>Besides, what do you mean,
"without permission?"</b>

01:53.840 --> 01:57.810
<b>The stuff on the table doesn't
all belong just to you.</b>

01:57.810 --> 02:01.750
<b>It wasn't just any potsticker!
It was the very last one!</b>

02:01.750 --> 02:04.220
<b>I'd even made sure to put it
on my personal plate!</b>

02:04.220 --> 02:07.320
<b>You haven't won until you've
put it in your mouth.</b>

02:07.320 --> 02:10.490
<b>If you think that's unfair, you should've
written your name on it.</b>

02:10.490 --> 02:13.430
<b>So, you DID eat it!</b>

02:13.430 --> 02:14.760
<b>Let's take it out front!</b>

02:14.760 --> 02:17.890
<b>What? You wanna go at it, monkey?
I'll make you cry like a baby.</b>

02:18.430 --> 02:21.340
<b>That's a really rowdy group over there.</b>

02:21.340 --> 02:22.970
<b>Are those brothers fighting?</b>

02:22.970 --> 02:24.910
<b>Nah, they don't look alike at all.</b>

02:28.610 --> 02:31.480
<b>Shut up, damn it! You wanna
die that badly?!</b>

02:34.820 --> 02:38.150
<b>Quit goofing off and eat already.
You're wasting time.</b>

02:38.150 --> 02:39.720
<b>This monkey...
But Gojyo...</b>

02:39.720 --> 02:41.190
<b>I WILL kill you.</b>

02:44.990 --> 02:48.290
<b>Hey, that outfit. He's a monk, right?</b>

02:49.500 --> 02:51.230
<b>He just fired a gun, right?</b>

02:51.930 --> 02:53.870
<b>Excuse me...</b>

02:53.870 --> 02:55.800
<b>When the heck?!</b>

02:55.800 --> 02:58.140
<b>My companion just fired off
a couple rounds.</b>

02:58.140 --> 02:59.980
<b>Are you all unhurt?</b>

02:59.980 --> 03:01.980
<b>Yes, we're fine.</b>

03:01.980 --> 03:06.450
<b>Oh, thank goodness. I'm very sorry
to have disturbed you.</b>

03:06.450 --> 03:08.540
<b>Please, enjoy your stay here.</b>

03:10.190 --> 03:11.650
<b>Come on, we're leaving!</b>

03:12.690 --> 03:14.150
<b>Goodbye.</b>

03:18.530 --> 03:21.060
<b>There are still some spring rolls left!</b>

03:21.060 --> 03:22.230
<b>Beer!</b>

03:22.230 --> 03:26.230
<b>Yes, yes. If we don't hurry up,
he really will shoot us.</b>

03:26.230 --> 03:27.440
<b>Spring rolls!</b>

03:27.440 --> 03:28.740
<b>Beer!</b>

03:28.740 --> 03:30.200
<b>Too slow!</b>

03:35.880 --> 03:37.540
<b>What the heck was that?</b>

03:50.390 --> 03:53.700
<b>It's pretty impressive for something
built by demons.</b>

03:53.700 --> 03:58.430
<b>It seems they formed a group with
this tower as their stronghold.</b>

03:58.430 --> 04:03.040
<b>What's the point of entrenching
ourselves in these boondocks?</b>

04:03.040 --> 04:05.640
<b>Homura seems to have taken
a liking to it.</b>

04:05.640 --> 04:09.340
<b>But isn't it just a bit too eccentric?</b>

04:09.340 --> 04:10.810
<b>Lord Zenon!</b>

04:11.950 --> 04:15.050
<b>The Heavenly Army Earth Detachment
Special Forces have assembled.</b>

04:15.050 --> 04:16.750
<b>We're ready to move out at any time.</b>

04:16.750 --> 04:19.590
<b>Move out? There's no need for that.</b>

04:19.590 --> 04:20.560
<b>My Lord?</b>

04:20.560 --> 04:21.090
<b>Homura will take this place alone.
My Lord?</b>

04:21.090 --> 04:23.020
<b>Homura will take this place alone.</b>

04:23.020 --> 04:24.660
<b>Alone?!</b>

04:24.660 --> 04:28.330
<b>Are you saying he'll storm this dubious
tower entirely on his own?!</b>

04:28.330 --> 04:32.570
<b>The War Prince has always
fought alone.</b>

04:32.570 --> 04:36.200
<b>Just as Lord Nataku did before him.</b>

04:36.200 --> 04:37.570
<b>But...</b>

04:37.570 --> 04:40.040
<b>Never mind, just shut up and watch.</b>

04:40.040 --> 04:41.510
<b>Yes, my Lord.</b>

05:17.610 --> 05:21.650
<b>So that's Mount Ryokai, said to be
at the horizon of light?</b>

05:21.650 --> 05:24.720
<b>And in the distant east, Chang'an.</b>

05:24.720 --> 05:27.620
<b>You have quite a survey of the land
from here, demon.</b>

05:28.590 --> 05:32.130
<b>Just what does the War God
want with us?</b>

05:32.130 --> 05:34.060
<b>So, west is that way?</b>

05:34.060 --> 05:37.970
<b>I guess Houtou Castle in India is
too far to see, even from here.</b>

05:37.970 --> 05:43.300
<b>War God, if your objective isn't to
subjugate us, then what is it?</b>

05:43.300 --> 05:46.400
<b>The gods of the Heavens should
have no business on Earth.</b>

05:47.210 --> 05:49.840
<b>You built a tower that pierces the sky.</b>

05:49.840 --> 05:54.510
<b>Do you feel like it makes you
closer to the gods, demon?</b>

05:56.620 --> 05:59.050
<b>Crawling on the ground,</b>

05:59.050 --> 06:02.490
<b>reaching for an unattainable dream
with all your might...</b>

06:02.490 --> 06:04.430
<b>That's not so bad either.</b>

06:04.430 --> 06:06.560
<b>What is it you want to say?!</b>

06:06.560 --> 06:08.260
<b>Nothing, just that,</b>

06:08.260 --> 06:13.570
<b>if you want, I wouldn't mind
granting you your wish.</b>

06:13.570 --> 06:15.470
<b>Our wish?</b>

06:15.470 --> 06:18.800
<b>Yes, I'll make you gods.</b>

06:20.710 --> 06:22.580
<b>Don't be ridiculous!</b>

06:22.580 --> 06:25.310
<b>It's only natural you'd think so.</b>

06:25.310 --> 06:27.380
<b>Sorry to have bothered you.</b>

06:27.380 --> 06:29.210
<b>Are you speaking the truth?</b>

06:32.320 --> 06:34.690
<b>Well, who knows?</b>

06:34.690 --> 06:37.890
<b>Could we truly become gods?</b>

06:37.890 --> 06:41.130
<b>There is one condition.</b>

06:41.130 --> 06:42.500
<b>Condition?</b>

06:42.500 --> 06:46.940
<b>Become my subordinates
and follow my orders.</b>

06:46.940 --> 06:50.710
<b>Are you telling all of us to become
the minions of the War Prince?</b>

06:50.710 --> 06:52.940
<b>Think well upon it.</b>

06:52.940 --> 06:55.510
<b>For a demon, becoming a god</b>

06:55.510 --> 06:58.650
<b>also means you'll no
longer be yourself.</b>

06:58.650 --> 07:00.980
<b>You're the one who'll make the choice.</b>

07:04.620 --> 07:07.350
<b>What? The tower's surrounded
by the Heavenly Army?</b>

07:10.890 --> 07:12.880
<b>War Prince, I ask of you...</b>

07:13.900 --> 07:15.990
<b>...to grant us our wish.</b>

07:18.000 --> 07:19.470
<b>Very well.</b>

07:29.240 --> 07:30.710
<b>Confer divinity.</b>

07:48.460 --> 07:51.700
<b>I liked the way you were before this.</b>

07:51.700 --> 07:53.470
<b>Though it may be an
unattainable dream,</b>

07:53.470 --> 07:57.270
<b>there's meaning in setting your sights
on it of your own will.</b>

07:57.270 --> 08:01.340
<b>You might be better off dead now
that you've become like this.</b>

08:01.340 --> 08:04.950
<b>Of course, that isn't for me to say.</b>

08:04.950 --> 08:07.420
<b>A demon is just a demon.</b>

08:07.420 --> 08:10.080
<b>Nothing more and nothing less.</b>

08:10.080 --> 08:12.850
<b>But that goes for gods too.</b>

08:15.960 --> 08:20.720
<b>You may have just fallen from a
position equal to that of the gods.</b>

08:26.500 --> 08:28.000
<b>Looks like it's done.</b>

08:28.000 --> 08:30.470
<b>It took longer than I expected.</b>

08:30.470 --> 08:33.610
<b>He probably made them choose
for themselves again.</b>

08:33.610 --> 08:39.280
<b>A waste of time. He should already
know what their choice will be.</b>

08:39.280 --> 08:43.110
<b>He might not look it, but our leader
is kind after all.</b>

08:45.090 --> 08:46.550
<b>Indeed.</b>

09:03.070 --> 09:05.770
<b>So, they've begun to move at last?</b>

09:05.770 --> 09:10.310
<b>Merciful Goddess, are you really
going to just let them do this?</b>

09:10.310 --> 09:11.850
<b>What do you mean?</b>

09:11.850 --> 09:14.750
<b>There must be various measures
you can take.</b>

09:14.750 --> 09:17.190
<b>For instance, report this
to the Jade Emperor</b>

09:17.190 --> 09:19.550
<b>or mobilize the Heavenly Army.</b>

09:19.550 --> 09:24.430
<b>Jiroushin, that's a pretty funny one
coming from you, that joke.</b>

09:24.430 --> 09:26.290
<b>Joke?!</b>

09:26.290 --> 09:29.900
<b>The Heavenly Army's job is to seal
away those in the Lower World,</b>

09:29.900 --> 09:32.070
<b>who would harm the Heavens.</b>

09:32.070 --> 09:36.370
<b>In other words, as long as the
Heavens aren't affected somehow,</b>

09:36.370 --> 09:39.270
<b>they won't mobilize the Heavenly Army.</b>

09:39.270 --> 09:41.680
<b>And what those guys are doing,
in terms of appearance,</b>

09:41.680 --> 09:44.280
<b>looks like they're subjugating demons.</b>

09:44.280 --> 09:46.110
<b>The Jade Emperor would in fact
even be grateful,</b>

09:46.110 --> 09:48.550
<b>he'd never order punitive
action against them.</b>

09:49.680 --> 09:51.890
<b>Not to mention that War Prince Homura</b>

09:51.890 --> 09:54.390
<b>is kin to the Jade Emperor</b>

09:54.390 --> 09:57.060
<b>even though he's half human,
half immortal.</b>

09:57.060 --> 09:58.430
<b>Yes, but...</b>

09:58.430 --> 10:00.400
<b>Children between gods and humans
is considered taboo,</b>

10:00.400 --> 10:04.930
<b>just like children between demons
and humans.</b>

10:04.930 --> 10:10.510
<b>The Heavens have always forced the
dirty work onto these abominations,</b>

10:10.510 --> 10:13.010
<b>much as they did to Nataku.</b>

10:13.010 --> 10:16.580
<b>The Heavenly Army and the Jade
Emperor are in no position</b>

10:16.580 --> 10:19.050
<b>to complain at this late date,
now are they?</b>

10:19.050 --> 10:21.020
<b>Yes, but it's as clear as daylight</b>

10:21.020 --> 10:24.420
<b>that they'll eventually rise
in rebellion against us!</b>

10:24.420 --> 10:25.990
<b>Peace has made this place complacent.</b>

10:25.990 --> 10:28.620
<b>No one will notice that.</b>

10:28.620 --> 10:32.360
<b>It'll be too late by the time
they do notice.</b>

10:32.360 --> 10:34.430
<b>The guys here won't be able
to do anything about it,</b>

10:34.430 --> 10:36.730
<b>and they'll get into a huge panic.</b>

10:36.730 --> 10:38.270
<b>That's what always happens.</b>

10:38.270 --> 10:42.970
<b>But if you know all that already,
why not take it upon yourself?</b>

10:42.970 --> 10:44.740
<b>You're kidding, right?</b>

10:44.740 --> 10:48.940
<b>There's no way in hell I'd interrupt
something this fun.</b>

10:50.140 --> 10:54.050
<b>Well, I think I'll just
sit back and watch.</b>

10:54.050 --> 10:56.780
<b>But...</b>

10:56.780 --> 11:01.350
<b>Looks like I'll be spared from
boredom for a good long while.</b>

11:13.700 --> 11:15.860
<b>You're completely booked?!</b>

11:16.740 --> 11:19.810
<b>I do have just one single open, but...</b>

11:19.810 --> 11:21.810
<b>That's fine. We'll take it.</b>

11:21.810 --> 11:25.080
<b>Take it? But there will
only be one bed.</b>

11:25.080 --> 11:27.380
<b>You guys set up camp outside.</b>

11:27.380 --> 11:29.680
<b>You gotta be kidding!</b>

11:29.680 --> 11:32.690
<b>Shut up. I'm the one paying here.</b>

11:32.690 --> 11:35.320
<b>It's the Sanbutsushin who're paying!</b>

11:35.320 --> 11:36.790
<b>Be quiet!</b>

11:37.730 --> 11:40.030
<b>Then, how about this?</b>

11:40.030 --> 11:42.530
<b>I'll lay down blankets next to the bed,</b>

11:42.530 --> 11:44.000
<b>so you can all be friendly-like and...</b>

11:46.830 --> 11:48.300
<b>Friendly-like?!</b>

12:03.620 --> 12:05.090
<b>You're going?</b>

12:06.350 --> 12:08.890
<b>Which way? West? Or...</b>

12:08.890 --> 12:12.260
<b>It's not yet the time to go east.</b>

12:12.260 --> 12:14.200
<b>In that case...</b>

12:14.200 --> 12:17.460
<b>West, Houtou Castle in India.</b>

12:19.730 --> 12:21.260
<b>In order to obtain...</b>

12:23.370 --> 12:24.800
<b>...the Seiten Scripture.</b>

12:28.740 --> 12:30.680
<b>Now, here's the problem.</b>

12:30.680 --> 12:33.780
<b>Three sets of bedding the lady
set out for us and one bed,</b>

12:33.780 --> 12:37.750
<b>which is practically a VIP position.</b>

12:37.750 --> 12:39.650
<b>Oh, dear.</b>

12:39.650 --> 12:43.620
<b>You'd better not expect ME
to sleep on the floor.</b>

12:43.620 --> 12:47.560
<b>We've been camping out for five days!
I want the bed too!</b>

12:47.560 --> 12:50.830
<b>Who the hell wants to sleep
side-by-side with other guys?</b>

12:50.830 --> 12:52.300
<b>A match, then.</b>

12:54.070 --> 12:55.540
<b>Fine.</b>

12:57.610 --> 13:00.510
<b>Then let's go with a
one-shot card game.</b>

13:00.510 --> 13:04.240
<b>The one who draws the
highest card wins.</b>

13:06.950 --> 13:07.680
<b>All right!</b>

13:07.680 --> 13:08.420
<b>Then I'll take this one.
All right!</b>

13:08.420 --> 13:09.140
<b>Then I'll take this one.</b>

13:11.190 --> 13:12.950
<b>What is it, Hakuryu?</b>

13:12.950 --> 13:15.480
<b>Hakuryu says he wants to join in too.</b>

13:16.560 --> 13:20.080
<b>You're just a car! What do
you care about a bed?!</b>

13:21.500 --> 13:23.960
<b>It wouldn't be nice to exclude him.</b>

13:24.900 --> 13:27.490
<b>Oh, fine, fine, hurry up and draw.</b>

13:31.470 --> 13:35.210
<b>Yes! I got a king! A king! I win!</b>

13:35.210 --> 13:39.410
<b>Idiot, big numbers don't
mean anything.</b>

13:39.410 --> 13:41.280
<b>I've got an ace.</b>

13:41.280 --> 13:42.880
<b>What?!</b>

13:42.880 --> 13:44.650
<b>Not so fast, you ignorant fools.</b>

13:45.920 --> 13:47.590
<b>The ace of spades?!</b>

13:47.590 --> 13:50.560
<b>Damn, I forgot about that!</b>

13:50.560 --> 13:52.030
<b>Well, excuse me...</b>

13:54.400 --> 13:57.190
<b>We both drew jokers.</b>

14:02.740 --> 14:05.140
<b>No way! I'm sleeping on the bed,
no matter what!</b>

14:05.140 --> 14:07.780
<b>Oh, bastard, quit acting like a kid!</b>

14:07.780 --> 14:09.310
<b>But I AM a kid!</b>

14:09.310 --> 14:10.780
<b>I'll beat you up!</b>

14:13.580 --> 14:14.050
<b>Get off, you bastard!</b>

14:14.050 --> 14:15.280
<b>Don't wanna, don't wanna,
don't wanna!
Get off, you bastard!</b>

14:15.280 --> 14:15.550
<b>Don't wanna, don't wanna,
don't wanna!
Don't "don't wanna" me!</b>

14:15.550 --> 14:16.750
<b>Don't "don't wanna" me!</b>

14:16.750 --> 14:20.660
<b>We shouldn't have settled the match
with cards to begin with.</b>

14:20.660 --> 14:23.690
<b>It was obvious Hakkai
was going to win.</b>

14:23.690 --> 14:27.250
<b>Hakuryu, the colored joker is
the stronger of the two, okay?</b>

14:30.770 --> 14:33.530
<b>Damn it, who put both jokers
in the deck?!</b>

14:33.530 --> 14:34.400
<b>That hurts! Get off me, Gojyo!</b>

14:34.400 --> 14:35.900
<b>Hey!
That hurts! Get off me, Gojyo!</b>

14:35.900 --> 14:36.440
<b>Everyone, I've brought you
a late-night snack.
That hurts! Get off me, Gojyo!</b>

14:36.440 --> 14:37.900
<b>Everyone, I've brought you
a late-night snack.
You're heavy, Gojyo!</b>

14:45.010 --> 14:48.210
<b>Please excuse me! I'll just
leave this here!</b>

14:50.280 --> 14:54.450
<b>I didn't see anything!
Please enjoy your stay!</b>

14:57.120 --> 15:00.830
<b>Hey, did she just have a huge
misunderstanding about us?</b>

15:00.830 --> 15:02.660
<b>What? Why?</b>

15:02.660 --> 15:05.600
<b>Oh, forget it! Just die!</b>

15:05.600 --> 15:07.440
<b>Well, then I'll be taking the bed.</b>

15:07.440 --> 15:08.900
<b>Goodnight.</b>

15:10.000 --> 15:13.110
<b>Hey, isn't it kind of bad to leave her
with the wrong idea?</b>

15:13.110 --> 15:16.410
<b>Hey! Oh, wait a minute, Hakuryu!</b>

15:16.410 --> 15:19.240
<b>If you sleep there, where am I
going to sleep?!</b>

15:22.420 --> 15:26.790
<b>Hey, you stupid monkey! You move
over! You had the weakest card!</b>

15:27.820 --> 15:30.630
<b>Hey, damn it! Quit sleeping!
Move it, monkey!</b>

15:30.630 --> 15:32.590
<b>Shut the hell up!</b>

15:53.780 --> 15:56.720
<b>The Lower World certainly leaves
little time for boredom, Konzen.</b>

15:57.450 --> 16:01.460
<b>At this rate, you've probably
forgotten all about the Heavens,</b>

16:01.460 --> 16:02.920
<b>since you were reborn.</b>

16:09.000 --> 16:14.730
<b>After all, back then, you were
bored unto death.</b>

16:23.740 --> 16:27.550
<b>I forget who it was, but a human
from the Lower World once said</b>

16:27.550 --> 16:30.020
<b>that boredom could kill a man.</b>

16:30.020 --> 16:33.320
<b>But here, death does not even exist.</b>

16:33.320 --> 16:36.290
<b>Your brain just melts away
at room temperature.</b>

16:41.400 --> 16:45.490
<b>"This is damn boring." It's written
all over your face, Konzen.</b>

16:49.040 --> 16:50.710
<b>It's none of your damn business.</b>

16:50.710 --> 16:53.640
<b>You certainly haven't learned
to speak more respectfully.</b>

16:53.640 --> 16:56.340
<b>You're speaking to the great
Merciful Goddess.</b>

16:56.340 --> 16:58.010
<b>Don't say that about yourself.</b>

16:58.010 --> 17:02.720
<b>If you've come to poke fun, go home.
I've still got work to do.</b>

17:02.720 --> 17:06.880
<b>Documents you have to stamp without
even really looking at them, right?</b>

17:08.460 --> 17:10.090
<b>Come with me.</b>

17:10.090 --> 17:11.730
<b>It seems Ascetic Egan brought back</b>

17:11.730 --> 17:15.400
<b>an interesting animal from
the Lower World.</b>

17:15.400 --> 17:16.900
<b>An animal?</b>

17:16.900 --> 17:22.100
<b>Yeah, it's ferocious for being so small,
and it's got golden eyes.</b>

17:25.770 --> 17:28.000
<b>It's been too long, Merciful Goddess.</b>

17:28.710 --> 17:31.010
<b>I thank you for your time
in your busy...</b>

17:31.010 --> 17:32.650
<b>Enough with the preliminary chitchat.</b>

17:32.650 --> 17:35.850
<b>You brought that youngling from
the Lower World, didn't you?</b>

17:35.850 --> 17:40.290
<b>Yes, Lady. A heretical, mysterious
being, born from a mystical rock</b>

17:40.290 --> 17:42.520
<b>at the heart of Mount Kaka's peak</b>

17:42.520 --> 17:45.030
<b>in Hourai Kingdom of the Land
of Toushoushin.</b>

17:45.030 --> 17:47.130
<b>Born from a rock?</b>

17:47.130 --> 17:50.260
<b>In other words, it's neither
human nor demon.</b>

17:50.260 --> 17:52.630
<b>It's a creature that the Earth
itself gave birth to.</b>

17:52.630 --> 17:56.200
<b>But the thing is, he's rather violent.</b>

17:56.200 --> 17:57.710
<b>Let me go!</b>

17:57.710 --> 17:59.430
<b>That hurts! Don't pull so much!</b>

18:02.080 --> 18:04.040
<b>Be quiet! Behave yourself!</b>

18:06.450 --> 18:10.550
<b>You said you'd gimme something
to eat! You liar!</b>

18:10.550 --> 18:12.690
<b>Definitely an animal.</b>

18:12.690 --> 18:14.850
<b>Or rather, he's like a wild monkey.</b>

18:27.330 --> 18:32.330
<b>That was when Son Goku
and Konzen Douji met.</b>

18:50.490 --> 18:52.620
<b>This is the first step towards reform.</b>

19:40.440 --> 19:45.710
<b>So, what would you do about
this situation, Nataku?</b>

19:48.050 --> 19:50.320
<b>Homura is the man who succeeded
to the title of War Prince</b>

19:50.320 --> 19:52.920
<b>after you became like that.</b>

19:52.920 --> 19:57.410
<b>He has been used by the Heavens as
an unclean being just like you.</b>

19:58.290 --> 20:01.430
<b>Exempted from the Heavens'
principle of taking no lives,</b>

20:01.430 --> 20:04.160
<b>a heretical being, given permission
to commit slaughter.</b>

20:06.870 --> 20:10.000
<b>It was painfully sorrowful to watch you,</b>

20:10.000 --> 20:12.230
<b>but he's a sad man as well.</b>

20:14.980 --> 20:17.540
<b>Yes, it's definitely true.</b>

20:52.510 --> 21:01.320
<b>Yukikau hito wa mina
omoi nimotsu seotte</b>

21:02.690 --> 21:13.120
<b>Touku ni yureru kagerou no naka ni
ashita o mitsukeru</b>

21:14.470 --> 21:24.570
<b>Kono te o kobore-ochiru
suna no you na kanjou</b>

21:25.910 --> 21:38.890
<b>Ano toki mune ni sasatta kotoba ga
fui ni uzuku kedo</b>

21:38.890 --> 21:50.340
<b>Hatenai yoru o kazoenagara
jibun no kakera sagashite ita</b>

21:50.340 --> 22:01.620
<b>Ushinau hodo ni kono omoi ga
tashika ni natteku</b>

22:01.620 --> 22:13.790
<b>lma nara kitto aruite yukeru
doko made mo</b>
